1. String String = """
     Str
    Str""";
The length of the string pointed to by String will be 8. // True

2. String string = """Str Str""";
The length of the string pointed to by string will be 7. // Fail to compile

3. String str = """
Str Str""";
System.out.println(str.charAt(4));
This will print S. // True

4. String String =
"""
   Str
    Str
""";
System.out.println(String.charAt(4));
This will print S. // False prints a newline

5. String String = """
     Str
    Str""";
This will not compile. // False compiles

